  m_Text: '<b>Variables and race conditions: </b>


    Using anonymous functions
    allows the use of <i>parameters</i> in functions as shown in this section''s
    code sample.


    Note that variables can be <b>modified</b> during the waiting
    period of an Action. If you need the values as they were when the action was
    scheduled you might need to create local variables to store them.


    This
    problematic behaviour is commonly found inside <I>for</I> loops. Try the looped
    actions in this script through the buttons. (Messages in console)'
