    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Delayed Actions (<b>DA</b>) is a <b>static</b> class, that means you can
    call it from anywhere.\nDA schedules your actions in an in-scene gameobject (<i>DontDestroyOnLoad</i>).
    \nThere, you can see every scheduled action and its time remaining; ordered by
    executor (monobehaviours). \n"
