    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "DA works with C# <b>delegates</b>, specifically with <>Actions (functions
    with no return and no params). Call <i>Do</i> and pass the function you want,
    the delay and who is executing the action (commonly 'this'); you can add a name
    for debugging purposes.\n\nIf you want to execute some code but not make it a
    funcion, then use <b>anonymous functions</b>.\n\nIn this section's <i>code</i>
    you'll see a sample script already running. \nNote the newly added <i>DelayedActions</i>
    GO in the <b>DontDestroyonLoad</b> scene (this won't happen if DA isn't used).
    Messages will appear on the <b>Console</b>. "
