    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Whenever there is a <b>master</b>-<b>slave</b> situation, you have the
    option to delay de action of <b>doing</b> the order or delay the action of <b>giving</b>
    the order.


    -Note that the <i>executor</i> of the DA needs to be the monobehavoiur
    that does whats being delayed, use this section''s code as an example.

    -Also
    note how aborting the actions will have different behaviours depending on the
    method used.'
