    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Do you need to know if an action has been completed? \nHow much time is
    left?\nYou can ask that info to DA using the action's id.\n-Use <b> IsScheduled(id)
    </b> to check whether said action is scheduled.\n-Use <b>GetTimeRemaining(id)
    </b> to check the time.\n-Use <b>GetAction(id)</b> to get the whole object and
    do whatever you want with it, change the locator, change the time remaining,
    cancel it, its up to you.\nThe last option is preferred for repeated queries.\n"
